_:b0_r14b1 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Sun & Rain Works' conceptual claim to art at auction (2009)";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300404670;
    crm:P72_has_language aat:300388277;
    a crm:E33_E41_Linguistic_Appellation.
_:b0_r14b2 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "record:priority-live-auction-2009";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300312355;
    a crm:E42_Identifier.
_:b0_r14b3 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "Supporting documentation is described at evidence-live-auction-2009 and includes 2008 Sotheby's correspondence and the public catalogue lot. Recommended framing: the artist's asserted conceptual designation of an auction engagement. Avoided claims: 'first in history', publicly witnessed live creation, or precedence over any later artist or event, absent independent recognition and separately published evidence.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
_:b0_r14b4 crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "The phrase 'made explicit over time' can now be given its earliest located date. On 2013-09-12 the studio principal set the designation down in writing to a university art museum, naming the Sotheby's lot and calling the consignment a performance act of Metaconceptual Art. That letter is the earliest dated articulation of this claim the studio has produced; it is the artist's own declaration, and it postdates the 2009 engagement by four years.";
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300435416;
    a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.
